    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Minor nit, but given that `MiniClue.gen_clues.marks()` generates clues for keymaps prefixed by `g'` or `` g` ``, I think it would make more sense to move [the clue for `g'`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1fdbb864e2015eb6f501394d593630f825154385/lua/mini/clue.lua#L761) and for [`` g` ``](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1fdbb864e2015eb6f501394d593630f825154385/lua/mini/clue.lua#L777`) inside `MiniClue.gen_clues.marks()`, so that the prefix descriptions are included as well by only using `MiniClue.gen_clues.marks()` :)",
    "closed_at": "2023-09-27T07:08:04Z",
